13:/**
14: * Real cross-provider transfer is OFF by default. It only runs when the operator
15: * explicitly sets ENABLE_REAL_MIGRATION=1 (and never in the sandbox). Otherwise
16: * the safe, progress-reporting SIMULATION below runs. The real engine
17: * (worker/migrate-real.ts) is hardened against shell injection and never lets a
18: * secret touch a command string. Enable it only after testing on a throwaway VM.
19: */
20:const REAL_MIGRATION = process.env.ENABLE_REAL_MIGRATION === "1" && !SANDBOX;
