201:/** Working headroom the transfer needs while images load/unpack. Mirrors the
202: *  engine's pre-flight allowance in worker/migrate-real.ts so the wizard's
203: *  "will it fit?" answer and the worker's refusal can never disagree. */
204:const MIGRATION_HEADROOM_BYTES = 2 * GiB;
205:void MIGRATION_HEADROOM_BYTES; // kept for reference; the worker owns the headroom allowance
